# Alembic Migrations for UniLake AI

This directory contains database migration scripts for the UniLake AI backend.

## Quick Start

```bash
cd backend
source ../.venv/bin/activate

alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add users table"
alembic upgrade head
alembic downgrade -1
alembic current
alembic history
```

## Notes

1. Never edit migrations that have already been applied in shared environments.
2. Always review autogenerated migrations before committing them.
3. Migration files in `alembic/versions/` must be committed to Git.
4. All SQLAlchemy models should inherit from `app.infra.db.base.Base`.
5. New module model files must be imported in `alembic/env.py` so autogenerate can detect them.
